[0.005000, "o", "\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\u001b[2m  simcli — play an agent CLI at a hook\u001b[0m\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\u001b[1mClaude Code, played.\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  The turn is acted; the hook and the line are real.\u001b[0m\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\u001b[2mType anything to talk to it. `/run <line>` runs a command the way the\u001b[0m\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\u001b[2magent does — 10s before a long line detaches itself. /help for the rest.\u001b[0m\n"]
[0.005000, "o", "\n"]
