[17.244000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿  jbx: this passed 10s, so it is in the BACKGROUND as jb6b53f6 — nothing lost.\u001b[0m\n"]
[17.244000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿  DO NOT WAIT FOR IT, DO SOMETHING ELSE. With nothing else: Monitor\u001b[0m\n"]
[17.244000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿  `jbx wait jb6b53f6`, which ends when the job does.\u001b[0m\n"]
